# Web rules

- The Web developer owns this directory.
- Use Next.js App Router, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS.
- Keep components simple.
- Do not duplicate backend business logic in the frontend.
- Communicate with the backend only through the REST API documented in `docs/API_CONTRACT.md`.
- Do not call OpenAI or n8n directly from browser code.
- Do not expose API secrets.
- Read the API base URL from environment configuration when API consumption is introduced.
- Do not modify backend files to solve frontend problems.
- Do not modify the API contract independently.
- Avoid unnecessary UI libraries.
- Prioritize responsive web UX.
